; Freeciv: the SDL2 client, with the 2D trident tileset. "Start New Game"
; starts freeciv-server beside it; settings and saves go to User/.
; SDL2_image decodes on the 68040 (SDL_IMAGE_DECODER=cpu): the host decode
; service took the lab's runtime down while the client loaded its
; thousand-odd flag and tile pictures (2 November 2026). Sound and music
; (stdsounds, stdmusic) play through SDL2_mixer.module and AHI, decoded on
; the 68040 too (SDL_MIXER_DECODER=cpu) until that fault is understood.
; For no sound, change "-P sdl" to "-P none".
FailAt 21
Stack 1000000
Set SDL_IMAGE_DECODER cpu
Set SDL_MIXER_DECODER cpu
freeciv-sdl2 -t trident -P sdl
